(k) the additional fee to be paid for restoration of the registration of design under sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 13; 

(l) the provisions subject to which the right of the registered proprietor shall be under sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 14; 

(m) the number of exact representation or specimen of the design to be furnished to the Controller under clause ( _a_ ) of sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 15; 

(n) the mark, words or figures with which the article is to be marked denoting that the design is registered under clause (b) of sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 15; 

(o) the rules to dispense with or modify as regards any class or description of articles any of the requirements of section 15 as to marking under sub-section ( _2_ ) of that section; 

